# Manual API requests for the REST Client VS Code extension (humao.rest-client).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{$dotenv PORT}}

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Upload a document. To try another, change the `<` path and the part's Content-Type (paths are relative to this file):
#   ./samples/text.pdf     application/pdf   2 pages with a text layer, read locally
#   ./samples/scanned.pdf  application/pdf   2 scanned pages, no text layer: read with OCR (Claude)
#   ./samples/image.png    image/png         a receipt as an image: read with OCR (Claude)
# @name upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./samples/text.pdf
--boundary--

### List documents, newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents

### Get the document from the last upload request
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{upload.response.body.$.id}}

### Get the text of the document from the last upload request, one entry per page; empty until the worker has run
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/{{upload.response.body.$.id}}/pages

### Get a document that does not exist, to see an error response
GET {{baseUrl}}/documents/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
